{"id":"ned3412afff","headline":"40% GST On Cigarettes Announced In Budget 2026 Triggers Meme Fest On Internet - Check It Out","summary":"Cigarette, tobacco and pan masala prices rose from February 1, 2026, after the government revised taxes on so-called sin goods. GST was raised to 40%, new excise duties were added, and a Health and National Security Cess was introduced.","why":"Excise and GST changes on tobacco alter company margins and government tax revenue, and they are closely watched by investors in consumer and tobacco stocks.","category":"economy","event_type":"regulation","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"New Delhi","country":"India","lat":28.61,"lon":77.21,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Free Press Journal","url":"https://www.freepressjournal.in/viral/40-gst-on-cigarettes-announced-in-budget-2026-triggers-meme-fest-on-internet-check-it-out"},"sources":[{"name":"Free Press Journal","url":"https://www.freepressjournal.in/viral/40-gst-on-cigarettes-announced-in-budget-2026-triggers-meme-fest-on-internet-check-it-out"}],"published_at":"2026-02-01T10:51:30Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T20:10:53Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"f92f94d769f6fe74","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T20:10:53Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-02-01T10:51:30Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-02-01T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/shopping-retail-store-1338629.jpg","alt":"shopping retail store (illustration)","credit":"1139623","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/store-clothes-clothing-line-1338629/"}}